Chapter: CvmmCalendarWeekday
  cites Cvmm chapter Calendar
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 The weekday of a calendar date (0 Sunday to 6 Saturday), which the day
 view's title shows; the title used to take the weekday of the epoch, a
 Thursday, for every date.

Section: Body

  line : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Text
  line (y) (m) (d) = show y & "-" & show m & "-" & show d & " " & dow-label (cal-dow-of y m d)

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (line 1970 1 1 & ", " & line 2000 2 29 & ", " & line 2026 6 22 & ", " & line 2026 11 1)
  end